      </entry>
      <entry>
        <para>5a. _____</para>
      </entry>
      <entry>
        <para>5b. _____</para>
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</table>

<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>Find the \(x\)-intercepts and the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2+6x\).</item>
</list>
<example><exercise>
  <problem>
    
    <para> What are the \(x\)-intercepts for the equation \(y=x^2+6x\)? </para>
      <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work. </para>
  </problem><solution>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
  <para>\((0,0)\),\((-6,0)\)</para>
</solution></exercise>
</example><div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="b0da5798-3224-4b84-9d0b-1a786fc7c7db" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
