  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
  <para>\((5,0)\),\((-5,0)\)</para>
</solution></exercise>
</example><div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="c3fe07d5-1b33-41d0-91ae-6398e9bad7a8" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
